# TypeScript/JavaScript Testing

> This file extends [common/testing.mdc](../common/testing.mdc) with TypeScript/JavaScript specific content.

## Selected Tools

- Use Jest for selected TypeScript unit and integration seams.
- Use React Testing Library for user-observable component behavior.
- Use Playwright for critical browser flows.

Prefer deterministic tests around source streaming, schema rejection, query
compilation and cursors, Dataset Event codecs, Apollo cache merging, URL
serialization, and export escaping. Final QA is risk-based; no blanket
coverage percentage applies.

Do not read `ui_demo.json` directly in tests. Use small sanitized fixtures
derived by the bounded inspection workflow.
